In the lab, the Magnet nearby box starts unticked. After the program has printed two lines, you tick the box. What do you see in the four lines in total?

```
void setup() {
  pinMode(4, INPUT_PULLUP);
  Serial.begin(9600);
}

void loop() {
  Serial.println(digitalRead(4) ? "acik" : "kapali");
  delay(500);
}
```

One pin of the reed is on D4 and the other on GND. Even though the magnet is far away, the LED now and then flickers on by itself. Which line is the problem?

```
const int REED = 4;

void setup() {
  pinMode(REED, INPUT);
  pinMode(13, OUTPUT);
}

void loop() {
  digitalWrite(13, digitalRead(REED) == LOW);
}
```
